<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Central Bank credit to govt rises in April.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Central Bank credit to govt rises in April.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank said on Friday its net credit to the government rose sharply by 35.4 percent to 53.1 billion rupees in April 1997 against the same period last year.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said in its latest economic report that net credit to the government in April last year was 39.2 billion rupees.</p>
<p>It was 50.7 billion rupees in March 1997.</p>
</text>
